<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Characterizing Online and Private Learnability under Distributional Constraints via Generalized Smoothness</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Moïse Blanchard
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_note"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Note: </span>equal contribution
</span>
